{"pin":"BH00837","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00837","anchor":"","first_line":"Glorified art Thou, O my Lord, my God! Unto whom shall I complain of that which Thou hast wrought against me through Thy power and sovereignty, and to whom shall I recount what [3.5s]... ...O My handmaid! Verily, the nations of the earth have arisen to harm me, and supporting them are those who wield power as well as the community of the Bayan","first_line_orig":"سبحانک اللهم یا الهی الی من اشکو ما فعلت بی بقدرتک و سلطانک و الی من اذکر ما  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"980","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.168","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"168"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA48:090","source":"INBA48","locator":"090","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v048/?page=92"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.067.03x","source":"AVK3","locator":"067.03x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-71.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS8.038ax","source":"MAS8","locator":"038ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS8/mas8-38.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LTDT.284-285x","source":"LTDT","locator":"284-285x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/LTDT.pdf#page=301"}]},{"code":"BH00837NAW","anchor":"naw","translations":[{"language":"hi","lang_name":"Hindi"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"tk","lang_name":"Turkmen"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"ceb","lang_name":"Cebuano"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"bn","lang_name":"Bengali"}]}]}
